    "seed_scope": "rule+pattern"
  },
  "schema_version": 1,
  "status": "CENSUS",
  "verification_hint": "After the fix the chain is a single switch on the same receiver, every former branch body is preserved verbatim under its case label, no 'break;' follows an unconditional 'return', and the else-fallthrough becomes 'default'. javac must report no unreachable statement.",
